# SecurePi — KITCHEN preset:  python edge/securePi.py @kitchen.args
# presets/common.args is applied automatically as the base; this file only
# overrides what differs for this location.

# Staff area: bags legitimately sit around longer, so be patient.
# Kitchens are a common pest hotspot, so keep the rodent detector responsive.
--zone kitchen
--unattended-time 300
